  "law of inertia": "### Newton's First Law of Motion (Law of Inertia)\n\n\u2022 **Core Statement:** An object at rest remains at rest, and an object in motion continues at constant velocity in a straight line unless acted upon by a net **unbalanced force**.\n\u2022 **Inertia:** The resistance of any physical object to any change in its velocity.",
